      "start_seconds": 41.82,
      "end_seconds": 63.54,
      "duration_seconds": 21.72,
      "text": "not with me. I'll bring it next time. Furosemide. I take it 40 milligrams every morning for the fluid. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I looked a few things up online and that probably didn't help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
