      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.52,
      "end_seconds": 92.05,
      "duration_seconds": 9.53,
      "text": "Moderate really. Uh I've also had low mood. I've also had a sore tongue for two days"
